        "multilangContent": {
          "en": {
            "id": 1,
            "content": "{\"story\":\"<p>RAMEN ICHIBANKEN is a well-known ramen chain originating from Nagoya with nearly 30 stores around Japan now officially arrived in Vietnam.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The story of Ichibanken's signature Tonkotsu broth will continue as it conquers the taste buds of Vietnamese customers and Japanese customers in Vietnam, offering a traditional dish rich in authentic local flavors</p>\"}"
